    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Build the tank of your dreams \u2014 one click at a time!</strong> <br>In <i>Panzer Klicker Mk I</i>, you take on the role of engineer, commander, and clicker-in-chief. Your mission: construct the ultimate armored beast by collecting parts, assembling a crew, and smashing anything that dares to roll into your sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude96 <strong>Gameplay:</strong> <br>Earn points by clicking tank. Spend your resources on <strong>tank parts</strong> (tracks, guns, armor \u2013 some marked <i>TOP SECRET</i>!) and recruit your elite <strong>crew</strong> \u2013 from commander to loader and two gunners. Every upgrade boosts your firepower and your clicking efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Retro style, modern destruction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic pixel-art visuals inspired by old-school war sims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple interface \u2013 parts on the left, crew on the right, YOUR TANK in the center</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score and rank system \u2013 climb to the general!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden upgrades and experimental tech!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your machine dominate the battlefield or end up a pile of scrap? One click can make the difference...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <i>Panzer Klicker Mk I</i> \u2013 Click &amp; build!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Build the tank of your dreams \u2014 one click at a time!</strong> <br>In <i>Panzer Klicker Mk I</i>, you take on the role of engineer, commander, and clicker-in-chief. Your mission: construct the ultimate armored beast by collecting parts, assembling a crew, and smashing anything that dares to roll into your sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude96 <strong>Gameplay:</strong> <br>Earn points by clicking tank. Spend your resources on <strong>tank parts</strong> (tracks, guns, armor \u2013 some marked <i>TOP SECRET</i>!) and recruit your elite <strong>crew</strong> \u2013 from commander to loader and two gunners. Every upgrade boosts your firepower and your clicking efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Retro style, modern destruction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic pixel-art visuals inspired by old-school war sims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple interface \u2013 parts on the left, crew on the right, YOUR TANK in the center</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score and rank system \u2013 climb to the general!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden upgrades and experimental tech!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your machine dominate the battlefield or end up a pile of scrap? One click can make the difference...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <i>Panzer Klicker Mk I</i> \u2013 Click &amp; build!</p>",
