    "legal_notice": "Perun's Forge collects only the data strictly necessary to keep your progress safe: your Steam ID (encrypted with RSA-2048-OAEP on your device, then immediately hashed with SHA-256 before storage), your public Steam nickname, the numeric platform code you\u2019re playing on (e.g. 0 = Steam), and the JSON-encoded game state containing your 13 upgrade values and 33 clicker counters, plus a small integer flag recording that you\u2019ve accepted this privacy policy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll data is transmitted over HTTPS/TLS 1.3 to our encrypted database volume in an EU data centre (AES-256 on disk and in backups), and retained for up to 24 months after your last activity, after which both the record and its backups are automatically purged. Local debug logs remain on your device unless you choose to send them to us.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe do not collect IP addresses, advertising IDs, analytics data, or any personal information beyond the items listed above. We never share data outside GDPR-compliant processors or transfer it outside the European Economic Area.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou may access, export, correct, or delete your save at any time by emailing peruns-forge@protonmail.com  from the address tied to your Steam account, and we will comply within 30 days.",
